          "source_title": "Funding for Alberta tech startups | Accelerate Fund",
          "source_content_hash": "a50d2bd2aa8c246e7ecde2c32174d4e0d03f174ac258a8afeba953f08763bcf2",
          "quote": "Early-stage co-investor for Alberta startups. What we invest in Alberta-based tech Early-stage startups Various B2B sectors Proven product demand Early-stage growth financing for Alberta tech Are you an Alberta tech startup seeking early-stage capital? Accelerate Fund looks to invest in high growth potential companies serving business or enterprise customers – that need funding to prove out a big market, attract talent to their team, and grow their companies large enough to warrant future capital raises to support that growth. We invest in entrepreneurs leading tech startups that are private, incorporated, and have a head office and more than 50% of employees located in Alberta. We focus on life sciences, digital transformation, and artificial intelligence and other emerging opportunities.",
          "quote_hash": "79c52ce208decc5f989dacda2773b04d153af0fbda71c3a647490cf103cc3b37"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "accelerate_about",
