          "source_title": "About Accelerate Fund - Our backers and team",
          "source_content_hash": "0451e636488095542a628ba24547dcfb20f65635753396ee9f33a96a3f7d20c5",
          "quote": "For startups to access Accelerate Fund investment, private angel investors need to be willing to invest equal or greater amounts into the investment round.",
